{
  "id": "PSA.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 17",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prière de David. Écoute, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.17.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.17.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", la justice ; sois attentif à mon cri ; prête l'oreille à ma prière, qui ne s'élève pas de lèvres trompeuses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Que mon droit sorte de ta présence, que tes yeux regardent à la droiture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as sondé mon cœur, tu [m']as visité de nuit ; tu m'as éprouvé au creuset, tu n'as rien trouvé ; ma pensée ne va pas au-delà de ma parole.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quant aux actions de l'homme, par la parole de tes lèvres je me suis gardé des voies de l'homme violent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Quand tu soutiens mes pas dans tes sentiers",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", mes pieds ne chancellent point.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je t'ai invoqué, car tu m'exauceras, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.17.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.17.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! Incline ton oreille vers moi, écoute mes paroles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rends admirable ta bonté, toi qui, par ta droite, sauves de [leurs] adversaires",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ceux qui se confient [en toi].",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garde-moi comme la prunelle de l'œil ; cache-moi sous l'ombre de tes ailes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "De devant ces méchants qui me dévastent, mes ardents ennemis qui m'entourent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils sont enfermés dans leur propre graisse ; de leur bouche, ils parlent avec hauteur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À [chacun de] nos pas, maintenant ils nous environnent ; ils fixent leurs yeux, se baissant jusqu'à terre",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il est semblable au lion avide de déchirer, et comme le lionceau qui se tient dans les lieux cachés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lève-toi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.17.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.17.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! devance-le, renverse-le ; délivre mon âme du méchant [par]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ton épée,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[Délivre-moi] des hommes [par]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ta main, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.17.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.17.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! des hommes de ce monde, [qui ont] leur portion dans cette vie, et dont tu remplis le ventre de tes biens cachés ; ils sont rassasiés de fils",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", et ils laissent le reste de leurs [biens] à leurs enfants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moi, je verrai ta face en justice ; quand je serai réveillé, je serai rassasié de ton image.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.18",
    "number": "18",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.16",
    "number": "16",
